+    // so the folded vector `i` is `sum_j w_j * coeffs[i + j * 2^log_block]`, where `w_j` is the
+    // product of the twiddles of the layers whose offsets add up to `j * 2^log_block`: the same
+    // field values as one layer at a time, with one buffer of the block's size per column instead
+    // of one of half the polynomial's (which, over the columns of a composition block filled in
